cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCFuse, please cite the paper below."
title: "SCFuse"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of SCFuse, which detects code-level weaknesses in Ethereum smart contracts by
  compiler-anchored, reliability-discounted evidential fusion of verified source, the bytecode control-flow graph and
  pseudo-source lifted from bytecode by a code foundation model.
